{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Lift up</b> — a second time, an allusion to the return of the Glory with the coming of the Redeemer, for the Glory was not in the Second Temple." "<b>And your heads</b> — the first is on account of what follows, as if he said: \"and lift up, O gates of eternity, your heads.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:27.511426016Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}